The Rust units are semantically ported to TypeScript. Credential discovery, secret storage,
login, polling and vendor error-body exposure are deliberately not copied. Kiki's approved
provider credentials/OAuth renewal and its existing nb-search keyUsage are used instead.
Kimi usage parsing directly reuses @kiki/oauth/managed-usage. OpenRouter key-limit adaptation
follows https://openrouter.ai/docs/api/reference/limits and reports key caps, not account funds.

