src/quotas/providers/kimi-code.js, zai.js; quota schema/cache/discovery lifecycle was consulted.
No vibe-usage source bytes are copied: Kiki already has the compatible Kimi parser, and
CC Switch provides the compatible plan fetchers without importing home-directory probing.

